title: M1_Exit
tags: 
colorID: 0
position: -1567,-1844
---
- but before we do business... there's something else.
-> What is it?
- If you're really going to descend, listen... there's something strange going on down there... after a while you'll start to feel it.
-> ...
- Physical pain. Phantoms. Nausea.
-> ...
- And it's not because of the corpses. It's something in the air, in the walls of this place. Some kind of neutron radiation, but different from anything we know. 
-> ...
- I've taped together a disruption field generator using their technology. It works, but overheats quickly.
-> ...
- I guess this is what happens when a blacksmith tries to be a neurosurgeon. You have to wait after each use or it won't turn on.
-> ...
- Here, take it.
-> Take the disruption device.
(You have attached the generator to your suit)
-> Go to camp overview...
<<stop>>
===
