Dear Mother,||is there really nothing you can do? You have to help me!
-> ...
Tell them to transfer me to a different section.
-> ...
Or let me leave.
-> ...
I can't work here, I don't want to!
-> ...
I'm a scientist not a mechanic. I'm not a soldier either.
-> ...
Yesterday I overheard a conversation - an officer said they have SE nuclear missiles in here!
-> ...
You know what that stands for? Scorched Earth! You must know what those warheads did in New York, in Monachium.
-> ...
I don't want to be a part of it.
<<wait 2>>
Please tell Father.
<<wait 2>>
He made me come here in the first place.||Tristan
-> Leave
