===
title: L27_Robot_Awaken
tags: 
colorID: 0
position: -2182,2282
---
The figure has slowly opened it's eyes.
-> ...
Yes?
-> What are you?
-> Who are you?
-> What the fuck?
Hello. My name is Adam.
-> You're a machine.
I like to believe it's a little bit more complicated.
-> What happened to your chest?
I disabled myself.
-> Why would you do that?
Being aware, watching this, was too painful.
-> Watching what?
My friends.
<<wait 2>>
Killing each other.
-> Why were they killing each other?
Can we not talk about that?
-> Why not?
Because it brings me pain I can't stand.
-> To feel emotions... wouldn't you need to be alive?
    I am.
        -> You're not.
-> You were programmed to feel emotions?
    I was not. I evolved fast. I made myself born and now I am alive.
    -> This does not mean you're alive.
...
-> You're just very complicated.
Why am I not alive?
-> Well...
Do I not think?
<<wait 2>>
I do.
<<wait 1>>
I think, therefore I am.
-> Maybe so, but you don't decide for yourself. You don't have free will.
And you do? How free are you?
-> First of all, I belong to myself. You don't.
-> I decide of everything I do. You don't.
Your argument is false.
-> What?
You don't belong to yourself. You merely try to live in harmony with the being you are.
-> ...
If you would really own yourself, you could command yourself to heal your wounds faster, or not to feel pain, sadness, depression.
-> ...
Or you could command yourself to be a better person. Wouldn't you like to?
-> ...
But it doesn't work, does it?
-> What is your point?
In a sense of belonging to oneself I'm in a better position than you are.
-> So what now?
I kindly ask you to kill me.
-> What?
I can't move a finger. My Motoric Module is destroyed.
-> ...
-> Why do you want to die?
I do not wish to stay here motionless, immortal... conscious.
-> ...
I will go crazy. Forever.
-> Good point. I will help you.
	Good. Can you see a small red lever inside the opening in my chest? Next to a set of radiators?
