All the lost technology is now for the taking.
-> ...
The fastest route was quickly calculated and the next day you were in Ankara, Turkey. The safest-closest place to the no go zone.
-> ...
Since then you’ve been on your own, venturing north, where no human set foot for the last two hundred years.
-> ...
Everything was going according to plan till yesterday. Till you fell from that cliff.
-> ...
Losing most of your equipment.
-> ...
Trying to find shelter and regroup, you stumbled upon an interesting find...
-> ...
...a circular hole in the ground leading under the surface. 
-> ...
This might be the place you were looking for.
-> ...
You’ve decided to set camp here.
-> ...
